# Overlay stacking

Read the canonical [overlay stacking guidance](../../.agents/skills/make-interfaces-feel-better/surfaces.md#overlay-stacking-and-nested-controls) before changing an overlay. Verify the nested control from inside its real parent surface, including desktop and mobile variants; a stubbed popup does not verify stacking.
